	(footprint "Library:Heatsink_Wakefield_272-AB"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "2398db51-343a-4a2a-820b-163d51fc2707")
		(at 232.5 104 -90)
		(descr "Wakefield 272-AB (plain, bolt-on; NOT 272-AB01/-02 vertical) black-anodised aluminium channel heat sink for two TO-220: 44.45 x 36.83 mm (1.750 x 1.450 in), 9.525 mm (0.375 in) above the PCB, 1.0 mm floor, trough 17.78 mm, two d3.66 mm holes on the trough centre line 13.46 mm from each trough end (9.91 mm apart). Pads 1/2: plated M3 holes (d3.2) with d7.0 rings on both sides for the nut and lock washer, both GND. Pad 1 is shared with the R21 (LTO 50) hole. 12 extra pads numbered 2: tented d0.3 mm GND stitching holes under the floor (no mask opening, solid zone connection). F.Cu keep-out (no tracks or vias; pour and pads allowed) = floor footprint + 1.5 mm. Courtyard = outline + 0.5 mm (nothing under the fins). https://media.digikey.com/pdf/Data%20Sheets/Wakefield%20Engineering%20PDFs/board_level_heat_sink.pdf")
		(tags "heatsink heat sink Wakefield 272 272-AB TO-220 channel board level")
