		(property "Note" "Wakefield-Vette (Wakefield Thermal) 272-AB PLAIN channel heat sink (not 272-AB01/-02), Digi-Key 345-1043-ND; carries R21 (LTO 50) face down. Hardware per board: 1x M3x12 pan head + DIN125 washer (R21 hole = pad 1), 1x M3x8 pan head + DIN6797-J internal-tooth washer (hole 2, bites the anodise and bonds the sink to GND), 2x M3 nut + DIN127 split washer on the B.Cu rings; non-silicone grease (Wakefield 126). Check fin to GND < 1 ohm after assembly."
